  "bio": "Shane Montie is a highly skilled tattoo artist known for his expertise in the black and gray style. Born into the Body Art industry, Shane has honed his craft while traveling extensively across the United States, from Alaska to Florida and New York to California. Clients seeking an artist with professionalism and a masterful touch in black and gray designs will find Shane based in Killeen, United States, ready to bring their visions to life.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Killeen, Texas, United States"
